🛡️ CYBER SHIELD – VISMAYAM

Interactive Cybersecurity Awareness Platform

About the Project

Cyber Shield is an interactive cybersecurity working model developed as part of Vismayam, a college exhibition.

The project aims to create awareness about cybersecurity threats and demonstrate how different security mechanisms work through interactive simulations.

Project Modules

1. Password Strength Checker – Evaluates the strength of sample passwords.
2. Phishing Detection Simulator – Helps users identify suspicious messages and phishing attempts.
3. Encryption and Decryption – Demonstrates how information can be securely encoded and decoded.
4. Firewall Simulator – Demonstrates how network traffic can be monitored and filtered.

Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Python (where applicable)

Project Objectives

- Promote cybersecurity awareness.
- Demonstrate common cyber threats.
- Encourage safe digital practices.
- Provide an interactive learning experience.

Team Collaboration

This repository serves as a common workspace for all project members.

Each member contributes to their assigned module, and all modules will be integrated into a single cybersecurity platform.

